---

<PageLayout
  title="Tech Projects and Demos"
  description="This section is for the projects related to NLP, Data Science, Machine Learning, Deep Learning"
  keywords={[
    'Natural Language Processing',
    'NLP',
    'Data Science',
    'machine learning',
    'deep learning',
  ]}
  image="/images/demos.jpg"
>
  <p>Demos and source code related to NLP, Data Science and Machine Learning.</p>

  <p>
    Looking for my free online tools (JSON, YAML, CSV, Base64, URL encoder, JWT)?
    <a href={DEVELOPER_TOOLS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer Tools &nearr;</a>
  </p>

  <h2 id="data-science-nlp-projects">Data Science, Natural Language Processing (NLP) Projects</h2>

  <p>
    These use Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Data Science knowledge and are connected to the Natural
    Language Processing (NLP) topics in some way. Most techniques are transferable to other topics as
    Deep Learning, Machine Learning techniques can be applied across different topics.
  </p>

  <p>I have divided the projects into</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Data Science Projects - Involving usage of Python, R. Many of these are related to NLP.</li>
    <li>Core NLP Projects - Java based for core NLP topics</li>
  </ol>

  <p>
    <strong>
      Note: The tables are searchable by words and columns can be sorted by clicking on the column
      names
    </strong>
  </p>

  <h3 id="data-science-projects">Data Science Projects</h3>
  <ProjectTables id="datascience" caption="Data Science projects" projects={dataScienceProjects} />

  <h3 id="core-nlp-related">Core Natural Language Processing (NLP) Related</h3>

  <p>At broader level i have worked on following topics:</p>
  <p>I have worked on core topics in NLP:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Syntactic and Semantic Analysis using Syntactic Parse Trees, Dependency Parsing, Linguistic
      Knowledge
    </li>
    <li>Relation Extraction, Semantic Role Labeling</li>
    <li>Named Entities Recognition (NER), Knowledge Graphs, Ontologies</li>
    <li>Discourse analysis at Sentence, Paragraph, Document Level for text</li>
    <li>Question Answering, Question Generation, Natural Language Generation (NLG)</li>
  </ul>

  <ProjectTables id="corenlp" caption="Core NLP projects" projects={coreNlpProjects} />
</PageLayout>
